  "analysis": [
    {
      "label": "Context",
      "text": "Extra time in an FA Cup semi-final replay at 1–1, with United down to ten men after Roy Keane's sending-off. Arsenal had the extra player and most of the ball."
    },
    {
      "label": "The turnover",
      "text": "Vieira's loose pass landed at Giggs's feet in United's half. With Arsenal players ahead of the ball, the winger had room to run at a back line that had to turn and defend while retreating."
    },
    {
      "label": "The dribble",
      "text": "Giggs ran straight at defenders rather than around them, using close control and sudden changes of pace to go past Vieira, Dixon and Keown in turn. Each had to commit, and none got a clean tackle in."
    },
    {
      "label": "The finish",
      "text": "With Adams sliding across and Seaman closing the angle, Giggs chose power over placement, lashing a left-foot shot high into the roof of the net, the one area a keeper spread low cannot cover."
    }
  ],
  "captions": [
    {
      "t": 0,
      "text": "Extra time, 1–1, and United are down to ten men."
    },
    {
      "t": 1,
      "text": "Vieira's pass is loose; Giggs picks it up in United's half."
    },
    {
      "t": 2.7,
      "text": "Giggs carries it past Vieira…"
    },
    {
      "t": 5.2,
      "text": "…goes by Dixon…"
    },
    {
      "t": 7.2,
      "text": "…and skips away from Keown."
    },
    {
      "t": 9.7,
      "text": "Adams slides across, but Giggs is into the box."
    },
    {
      "t": 10.5,
      "text": "Left foot, from a tight angle, high over Seaman."
    },
    {
