  "commentary": [
    {
      "t": 0,
      "text": "Deep into extra time at Villa Park, and Arsenal have the ball…"
    },
    {
      "t": 1,
      "text": "Vieira looks for a team-mate — and gives it straight to Giggs."
    },
    {
      "t": 2.7,
      "text": "Giggs away from Vieira, driving forward…"
    },
    {
      "t": 5.2,
